model {
  extend basalt.poolRuntime {
    metadata {
      constraint "Home validates its per-process database connection budget before dialing. The supervisor allocates six open and six idle connections, with five-minute idle expiry and thirty-minute lifetime, on the direct transport with unchanged advisory locks. Config, polling, cleanup and log writes share the bounded pool without nested checkout, while carry 0691 moves liveness and election to their own pool; diagnostics expose process-local open, in-use, idle and wait counters. Server capacity must account separately for the controller, gateway and service clients."
    }
  }
}
